      "wrapper_summary": "Each of five independent wrappers has a held-slot gate and conditional same-key .5 fallback; the own-tier damage_vs_electrocuted override supplies +10/+15/+20/+25%, not an additive .5."
    },
    "findings": [
      "Player trigger and common effect match the approved config/draft and map; five family-specific summaries match the formal README, compatibility table, map variants, and reverse weapon pages. Inventory is five variants and eight actual marks across five weapon families.",
      "All five own trait tiers use +10/+15/+20/+25%; each formatter reads its weapon implementation’s own override. The live target condition is any of six electrocuted group keywords, without an owner/source-weapon gate, and the stat enters the general damage pool. Under stated assumptions, 100→125 and 120→145 correctly show +25 absolute damage and 20.83% relative increase in the latter case.",
      "Powermaul P1 M1/M2 each use five damage instances; each resolves damage before adding sticky electrocuted. The first cannot use its own later status, and a later instance in the same update loop is not guaranteed to see the refreshed keyword. The target status lasts .7 seconds per stack up to five (3.5 seconds), shares one start time, and refreshes it on additions including at cap.",
      "Powermaul P2 M1 resolves damage before its primer: an already-electrocuted target gets the 3.5-second keyword-bearing interval stun; an un-electrocuted target gets only the .1-second basic stun without that keyword. Shotgun P4 M1 applies its 3-second electrocuted stun after the pellet batch; its interval damage skips a staggered chaos_poxwalker_bomber while the keyword may remain. P4 M2 applies 8-second +.25 rending only, with no electrocuted keyword.",
      "Powermaul-shield P1 shout applies no electrocuted status and has zero near/far armor attack modifiers. Player text limits no-life-damage to cases without another modifier change and makes no positive damage claim from Attack.execute alone.",
      "Ordinary/charged attacks, push follow-ups, zero-damage pushes, weapon-specific special attacks, first application, refresh/removal, switching, and all eight model restrictions are covered without treating visual shock or rending as electrocuted.",
      "English and zh-TW RAW pairs use the same localization resource/hash; the source key spelling electrocuded and trait-ID suffix spelling electrocuted are preserved. Icon path, ID, and attachment URL remain distinct and match the verified image receipt. FASTER remains unverified and is not claimed as enabled."
    ],
    "resolved_corrections_verified": [
      "Shield-shout near/far armor attack modifiers are zero; no direct life damage is claimed absent another modifier change.",
      "Powermaul sticky duration is .7 seconds per current stack, up to five, with a shared refreshed start time rather than independent timers.",
      "Shotgun special-stun interval damage skips a staggered poxwalker bomber while electrocuted keyword may remain."
    ],
